==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|EL.|novēna}}, from {{der|en|la|novēnus|t=nine [each]}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|novenae}}

# {{lb|en|Roman Catholicism}} A [[recitation]] of [[prayer]]s and [[devotion]]s for [[nine]] [[consecutive]] days, especially one to a [[saint]] to ask for their [[intercession]].

